ty nine right now  when we hit 2,000 patrons I will do a  very very special live event it will be  a live chess game where I will play  chess against Pat and max on a live  stream when we get to 2,000 patrons  we also are adding a bunch of new perks  patrons now at the $5 level  and all members will get a permanent 15%  discount code for all of our gear this  includes t-shirts and bumper stickers  and coffee patrons at the $10 level get  a free bumper sticker at the $25 level  you'll get a free coffee mug the $50  level gets a free t-shirt and then at  the hundred level and above we've got  some really great packages available  which you can read about at patreon.com  slash david pakman show and you still  have the 40% discount code available for  memberships okay so that is still the  baseline stalwarts number one source of  income for the show david pakman.com  slash membership if you want a 40%  discount code have a 40% discount code  it is vote soon 18 so we're really  exciting new chapter for the show we've  got some great interviews coming up that  max and Pat have been working on we now  are going to have more time to flesh out  ideas with some great guests and I'm  really glad that you are going to be a  part of this so check it out read about  it patreon.com slash david pakman show  david pakman.com slash membership and  send me your thoughts on twitter about  whether you like the expanded david  pakman show I'm on twitter at D Pakman  and the show is on Twitter at David  Pakman show
 

